1
00:00:09,170 --> 00:00:12,610
LEE JAE-IN, KIM WOO-SEOK, CHOI YE-BIN

2
00:00:13,210 --> 00:00:16,850
CHA WOO-MIN, AN JI-HO, JUNG SO-RI

3
00:00:17,490 --> 00:00:20,930
SCRIPTWRITER: KANG MIN-JI

4
00:00:21,490 --> 00:00:25,010
DIRECTOR: IM DAE-WOONG

5
00:00:27,010 --> 00:00:31,317
NIGHT HAS COME

6
00:00:31,410 --> 00:00:33,010
ALL PEOPLE, ORGANIZATIONS, LOCATIONS,

7
00:00:33,010 --> 00:00:34,650
AND INCIDENTS IN THIS DRAMA ARE FICTITIOUS.

8
00:01:04,090 --> 00:01:06,050
CHA YU-JUN IS A DOCTOR

9
00:01:06,450 --> 00:01:07,570
What's this?

10
00:01:08,898 --> 00:01:10,058
I'm a Citizen.

11
00:01:10,208 --> 00:01:11,375
- What about you?
- I'm...

12
00:01:11,631 --> 00:01:12,991
YOU CAN SELECT 1 PARTICIPANT
AND USE YOUR HEAL SKILL

13
00:01:13,125 --> 00:01:14,664
THE SELECTED PARTICIPANT WILL BE
PROTECTED FROM THE MAFIA'S ATTACK

14
00:01:19,513 --> 00:01:20,433
WILL YOU USE IT ON CHA YU-JUN?

15
00:01:20,592 --> 00:01:21,512
YES

16
00:01:21,576 --> 00:01:22,004
HEAL SKILL USED ON CHA YU-JUN

17
00:01:26,770 --> 00:01:27,754
Ji-soo.

18
00:01:27,830 --> 00:01:29,378
THE SELECTED PARTICIPANT WILL BE
PROTECTED FROM THE MAFIA'S ATTACK

19
00:01:29,473 --> 00:01:30,840
YOU CAN REVIVE SOMEONE
WHO WAS VOTED FOR AND EXECUTED

20
00:01:33,447 --> 00:01:35,387
No.

21
00:01:38,385 --> 00:01:39,505
WILL YOU USE IT ON PARK JI-SOO?

22
00:01:39,530 --> 00:01:41,422
48 HOURS HAVE NOT YET PASSED
SINCE YOU LAST USED HEAL

23
00:01:41,504 --> 00:01:42,562
ADHERE TO THE COOLDOWN TIME

24
00:01:42,730 --> 00:01:43,730
What's this?

25
00:01:46,530 --> 00:01:47,930
Ji-soo.

26
00:01:50,322 --> 00:01:51,522
Ji-soo.

27
00:01:53,045 --> 00:01:54,383
I don't want to die.

28
00:01:55,135 --> 00:01:56,215
You won't die.

29
00:01:58,023 --> 00:01:59,623
I'll never let you die.

30
00:02:00,808 --> 00:02:02,048
We should go home.

31
00:02:03,222 --> 00:02:04,302
Don't you want to go home?

32
00:02:06,551 --> 00:02:07,591
I do.

33
00:02:09,194 --> 00:02:10,314
It's me.

34
00:02:11,027 --> 00:02:12,278
I'm the Mafia.

35
00:02:12,393 --> 00:02:13,593
It's not you.

36
00:02:14,072 --> 00:02:15,472
It's really not you.

37
00:02:16,417 --> 00:02:17,617
Don't.

38
00:02:17,705 --> 00:02:18,745
It's not him!

39
00:02:18,770 --> 00:02:19,921
Don't do it!

40
00:02:19,991 --> 00:02:20,937
HEAL SKILL USED ON KIM JUN-HEE

41
00:02:21,257 --> 00:02:22,257
Hey.

42
00:02:23,112 --> 00:02:23,952
Take it back.

43
00:02:24,017 --> 00:02:25,297
Say you're not the Mafia!

44
00:02:31,525 --> 00:02:34,970
EPISODE 8

45
00:02:46,193 --> 00:02:47,244
Did you find the photo album?

46
00:02:47,714 --> 00:02:48,834
It's not on the first floor.

47
00:02:49,561 --> 00:02:50,601
No.

48
00:02:51,880 --> 00:02:53,320
I swear it was here.

49
00:02:54,473 --> 00:02:55,673
It must be somewhere.

50
00:02:55,900 --> 00:02:56,823
Let's keep looking.

51
00:03:03,133 --> 00:03:04,776
<i>Cha Yu-jun...</i>

52
00:03:04,868 --> 00:03:06,799
- <i>...has died.</i>
- Yu-jun?

53
00:03:06,877 --> 00:03:09,117
- <i>Cha Yu-jun was...</i>
- Why?

54
00:03:09,142 --> 00:03:10,622
<i>...the Doctor.</i>

55
00:03:10,986 --> 00:03:13,346
<i>All participants,</i>

56
00:03:13,582 --> 00:03:16,782
<i>identify the Mafia and begin to vote.</i>

57
00:03:21,450 --> 00:03:22,970
He didn't break any rules.

58
00:03:24,417 --> 00:03:26,697
So why did he...

59
00:03:27,465 --> 00:03:28,790
Did he fall?

60
00:03:29,455 --> 00:03:30,935
He didn't fall.

61
00:03:31,800 --> 00:03:33,160
Someone killed him.

62
00:03:34,081 --> 00:03:36,001
There are lots of signs of a struggle,

63
00:03:36,850 --> 00:03:38,570
and there are wounds on his head.

64
00:03:39,705 --> 00:03:41,120
Someone attacked him.

65
00:04:10,745 --> 00:04:12,405
I bet it was the Mafia.

66
00:04:15,496 --> 00:04:16,536
I don't know.

67
00:04:17,432 --> 00:04:19,979
Even if it was, this is wrong.

68
00:04:21,968 --> 00:04:24,260
How could they kill during the day?

69
00:04:26,704 --> 00:04:27,822
What will you do now?

70
00:04:28,637 --> 00:04:30,369
Find out who did it.

71
00:04:34,770 --> 00:04:36,692
Why do you think Yu-jun was here?

72
00:04:40,954 --> 00:04:42,239
Yoon-seo.

73
00:05:29,618 --> 00:05:31,690
The Mafia are insane.

74
00:05:32,530 --> 00:05:34,305
They're killing during the day now?

75
00:05:35,687 --> 00:05:37,687
Even if Yu-jun was the Doctor,

76
00:05:39,823 --> 00:05:41,110
this is too much.

77
00:05:42,055 --> 00:05:44,422
Let's just catch the darn Mafia.

78
00:05:45,384 --> 00:05:46,907
Who on earth is it?

79
00:05:47,437 --> 00:05:48,637
Darn it.

80
00:05:57,512 --> 00:05:59,727
- Hey, guys.
- What?

81
00:06:00,393 --> 00:06:02,953
- Come over here.
- What for?

82
00:06:04,938 --> 00:06:05,978
What's this?

83
00:06:08,050 --> 00:06:08,970
What is it?

84
00:06:09,050 --> 00:06:10,090
KIM JUN-HEE IS THE MAFIA

85
00:06:10,170 --> 00:06:11,210
JIN DA-BEOM IS THE MAFIA

86
00:06:11,290 --> 00:06:12,130
FROM THE POLICE

87
00:06:13,705 --> 00:06:14,581
Jun-hee...

88
00:06:15,289 --> 00:06:17,776
...and you are the Mafia?

89
00:06:18,225 --> 00:06:19,225
No.

90
00:06:19,250 --> 00:06:20,617
I'm really not part of the Mafia.

91
00:06:20,945 --> 00:06:22,345
Guys, I'm not.

92
00:06:22,370 --> 00:06:23,400
I'm a Citizen.

93
00:06:23,425 --> 00:06:24,835
Who wrote this and why?

94
00:06:24,860 --> 00:06:25,860
It's really not me.

95
00:06:26,322 --> 00:06:28,195
The Police used their Skill twice.

96
00:06:28,801 --> 00:06:30,321
I think it makes sense that it's two.

97
00:06:31,807 --> 00:06:33,914
But earlier it said Jun-hee was a Citizen.

98
00:06:37,621 --> 00:06:39,025
I'm not part of the Mafia either.

99
00:06:42,471 --> 00:06:43,791
Don't lie.

100
00:06:43,969 --> 00:06:46,400
I bet the Police wrote this
because the last one was a lie.

101
00:06:46,756 --> 00:06:47,564
Right.

102
00:06:48,023 --> 00:06:49,757
The real Police would name the Mafia.

103
00:06:49,782 --> 00:06:51,302
Why would they name a Citizen?

104
00:06:51,791 --> 00:06:52,831
No.

105
00:06:53,967 --> 00:06:55,727
This could be fake.

106
00:06:56,208 --> 00:06:58,648
It's weird how it
appeared right after Yu-jun died.

107
00:06:59,105 --> 00:07:00,465
The person who killed him...

108
00:07:00,490 --> 00:07:02,942
...could've written this
to frame them as the Mafia.

109
00:07:05,072 --> 00:07:06,232
You guys.

110
00:07:06,927 --> 00:07:08,047
Why did you get here so late?

111
00:07:08,739 --> 00:07:09,959
Didn't you write this?

112
00:07:10,055 --> 00:07:12,535
If so, Yoon-seo wouldn't have said
what she just did.

113
00:07:14,448 --> 00:07:15,968
What on earth is this anyway?

114
00:07:16,275 --> 00:07:17,243
JUN-HEE IS A CITIZEN

115
00:07:17,290 --> 00:07:18,095
FROM THE POLICE

116
00:07:24,055 --> 00:07:25,095
Police.

117
00:07:25,656 --> 00:07:27,216
Quit all this and show yourself.

118
00:07:33,983 --> 00:07:34,823
Show your phones.

119
00:07:34,880 --> 00:07:35,760
Let's see your Skills.

120
00:07:36,160 --> 00:07:37,760
There's no need to do that.

121
00:07:38,438 --> 00:07:40,198
The person who killed Yu-jun.

122
00:07:42,064 --> 00:07:43,624
I think I know who it is.

123
00:07:48,952 --> 00:07:50,552
You said you'd tell us who did it.

124
00:07:51,160 --> 00:07:52,360
Why did you bring us here?

125
00:07:54,250 --> 00:07:55,624
In the warehouse...

126
00:07:57,233 --> 00:07:58,975
...I found a footprint.

127
00:08:01,550 --> 00:08:02,990
And this was next to it.

128
00:08:04,856 --> 00:08:07,416
I think it's from the shoe
of Yu-jun's killer.

129
00:08:20,273 --> 00:08:21,593
This is the same one.

130
00:08:22,785 --> 00:08:25,850
It stood out because I found it
weird there was a blank.

131
00:08:27,207 --> 00:08:28,356
I think this explains it.

132
00:08:34,271 --> 00:08:37,317
This is an accessory
lots of basketball shoes have.

133
00:08:37,370 --> 00:08:38,106
Basketball shoes?

134
00:08:42,824 --> 00:08:44,144
What?

135
00:08:55,431 --> 00:08:56,367
Is this yours?

136
00:08:56,850 --> 00:08:58,893
Why would you say that, you wench?

137
00:08:58,918 --> 00:09:00,598
Show us your shoes so we can check.

138
00:09:00,977 --> 00:09:02,977
I don't use that, okay?

139
00:09:03,240 --> 00:09:04,720
Let's see and find out.

140
00:09:11,684 --> 00:09:13,558
Take a look then.

141
00:09:17,371 --> 00:09:18,556
It's not his.

142
00:09:18,809 --> 00:09:20,862
I told you so.

143
00:09:22,298 --> 00:09:24,034
What?

144
00:09:25,072 --> 00:09:28,097
It's really not me.
Why suspect me?

145
00:09:28,328 --> 00:09:30,448
If you're innocent, show us, then.

146
00:09:31,185 --> 00:09:33,505
- Yes, let's see.
- It's not me.

147
00:09:33,530 --> 00:09:35,490
It's not me!

148
00:09:36,287 --> 00:09:37,927
Will you stop it?

149
00:09:44,224 --> 00:09:45,457
Darn it.

150
00:09:50,314 --> 00:09:51,714
Who bit you?

151
00:09:55,753 --> 00:09:57,193
It really was you.

152
00:09:59,456 --> 00:10:00,656
Why did you do it?

153
00:10:02,392 --> 00:10:03,432
It wasn't me.

154
00:10:03,960 --> 00:10:05,277
I didn't kill him.

155
00:10:05,302 --> 00:10:06,862
We found the weapons you used.

156
00:10:06,887 --> 00:10:08,007
Don't try to lie.

157
00:10:09,670 --> 00:10:10,883
Darn it.

158
00:10:11,705 --> 00:10:13,092
Shall I tell the truth?

159
00:10:13,748 --> 00:10:15,060
Go Kyung-jun killed him.

160
00:10:15,085 --> 00:10:16,405
It wasn't me!

161
00:10:16,430 --> 00:10:17,510
What are you saying, psycho?

162
00:10:17,535 --> 00:10:19,201
The shoe and brick says it's you!

163
00:10:19,689 --> 00:10:20,849
How do you know that?

164
00:10:23,585 --> 00:10:24,957
We never mentioned a brick.

165
00:10:24,982 --> 00:10:26,102
How did you know about it?

166
00:10:27,391 --> 00:10:28,431
What?

167
00:10:29,424 --> 00:10:31,912
Jin-ha was with someone else
in the warehouse.

168
00:10:33,185 --> 00:10:35,990
We found another identical footprint
but without the heel pad.

169
00:10:38,209 --> 00:10:39,289
It was you, wasn't it?

170
00:10:40,368 --> 00:10:41,232
Go Kyung-jun.

171
00:10:42,368 --> 00:10:43,448
Guys.

172
00:10:43,651 --> 00:10:44,931
It really wasn't me.

173
00:10:45,467 --> 00:10:46,877
He killed Yu-jun.

174
00:10:47,158 --> 00:10:48,854
He killed Seung-bin too.

175
00:10:49,199 --> 00:10:51,319
You have that darn ax too.

176
00:10:51,344 --> 00:10:52,384
You lunatic.

177
00:10:52,409 --> 00:10:53,609
You fool.

178
00:10:54,543 --> 00:10:56,432
- Take this.
- Hey!

179
00:10:56,502 --> 00:10:58,102
- Darn it.
- Stop it!

180
00:10:58,127 --> 00:11:00,360
- Will you stop?
- Get your hands off me!

181
00:11:00,385 --> 00:11:02,065
You killed him, you dirtbag.

182
00:11:02,090 --> 00:11:03,050
Let go.

183
00:11:03,090 --> 00:11:04,440
I said let go of me.

184
00:11:08,719 --> 00:11:09,628
Kyung-jun!

185
00:11:09,659 --> 00:11:11,784
Will you all get off me?

186
00:11:11,960 --> 00:11:12,893
You lunatic!

187
00:11:22,822 --> 00:11:23,771
Hey.

188
00:11:23,839 --> 00:11:24,959
Let go.

189
00:11:25,723 --> 00:11:27,009
Stay away from me.

190
00:11:27,034 --> 00:11:28,194
You scumbag!

191
00:11:32,951 --> 00:11:34,324
Jun-hee!

192
00:11:34,349 --> 00:11:35,826
Come at me!

193
00:11:35,851 --> 00:11:37,011
I'll take you on!

194
00:11:37,130 --> 00:11:38,210
Get off me!

195
00:11:38,235 --> 00:11:39,804
Come and get me!

196
00:11:39,829 --> 00:11:40,989
Darn it!

197
00:11:46,336 --> 00:11:47,637
I'm okay.

198
00:11:53,470 --> 00:11:54,470
Hey.

199
00:11:55,610 --> 00:11:57,030
What's that?

200
00:12:00,529 --> 00:12:02,129
What a mess.

201
00:12:12,048 --> 00:12:13,888
Did you write it with this?

202
00:12:14,736 --> 00:12:16,496
And you still say he's not the Mafia?

203
00:12:16,927 --> 00:12:18,447
When he wrote all that?

204
00:12:19,130 --> 00:12:20,290
What's this?

205
00:12:20,720 --> 00:12:22,120
Did you name them as the Mafia?

206
00:12:22,519 --> 00:12:23,519
No.

207
00:12:23,915 --> 00:12:25,195
I didn't write it.

208
00:12:25,928 --> 00:12:28,128
Guys, wait.

209
00:12:28,210 --> 00:12:30,290
Don't do anything.

210
00:12:33,305 --> 00:12:35,265
I don't know what's going on!

211
00:12:35,290 --> 00:12:37,518
- Honestly.
- We have the answer.

212
00:12:37,543 --> 00:12:38,715
Vote already.

213
00:12:38,740 --> 00:12:39,860
Hey, Jun-hee.

214
00:12:40,229 --> 00:12:41,418
It wasn't me.

215
00:12:41,478 --> 00:12:43,512
You're the class president!

216
00:12:44,187 --> 00:12:45,987
I don't know what's happening.

217
00:12:47,269 --> 00:12:51,155
Please, Jung-won.

218
00:12:52,185 --> 00:12:53,305
What a joke.

219
00:12:53,370 --> 00:12:54,890
I'm innocent.

220
00:12:54,930 --> 00:12:55,970
He's 100 percent the Mafia!

221
00:12:55,995 --> 00:12:57,822
Let's vote and be done with it!

222
00:12:57,847 --> 00:12:59,047
Will you stop it?

223
00:13:01,273 --> 00:13:03,202
You killed Yu-jun too.

224
00:13:04,837 --> 00:13:06,382
We'll vote at 11 p.m.

225
00:13:07,320 --> 00:13:08,845
You two should wait in a room.

226
00:13:20,735 --> 00:13:22,455
Don't leave the room.

227
00:13:26,574 --> 00:13:28,575
Is this a prison cell?

228
00:13:32,544 --> 00:13:33,489
What?

229
00:13:34,504 --> 00:13:36,106
- Hand over the keys.
- Why?

230
00:13:36,758 --> 00:13:38,318
What if you get out?

231
00:13:38,928 --> 00:13:40,968
How are we to know you won't kill again?

232
00:13:44,487 --> 00:13:46,607
We'll all use the cafeteria now.

233
00:13:46,869 --> 00:13:47,582
Hand over the keys.

234
00:13:47,607 --> 00:13:48,857
They're gone. I lost them.

235
00:13:49,010 --> 00:13:50,072
Don't lie.

236
00:13:50,097 --> 00:13:51,237
Hand them over already.

237
00:13:51,262 --> 00:13:52,924
I don't have them, okay?

238
00:13:56,545 --> 00:13:57,741
Then give me your phone.

239
00:13:57,897 --> 00:13:59,101
I'll keep that as collateral.

240
00:14:03,726 --> 00:14:05,566
You can't go anywhere without your phone.

241
00:14:06,542 --> 00:14:08,022
You murdered someone.

242
00:14:08,132 --> 00:14:09,569
It's the least you can do
to make us trust you.

243
00:14:17,803 --> 00:14:19,455
What on earth, Da-beom?

244
00:14:19,487 --> 00:14:20,927
You'll get it back at voting time.

245
00:14:41,607 --> 00:14:42,727
Guys.

246
00:14:43,877 --> 00:14:45,908
I really am not the Mafia.

247
00:14:46,785 --> 00:14:48,261
I didn't kill Seung-bin.

248
00:14:48,784 --> 00:14:50,584
Don't vote for me, okay?

249
00:14:51,751 --> 00:14:53,526
I really am not the Mafia.

250
00:15:00,329 --> 00:15:01,389
I'm a Citizen.

251
00:15:02,040 --> 00:15:03,819
I must live if you're to live.

252
00:15:15,439 --> 00:15:17,319
This is the men's room.

253
00:15:17,422 --> 00:15:18,582
I know that.

254
00:15:20,354 --> 00:15:22,280
- What?
- Where do you think...

255
00:15:22,305 --> 00:15:23,625
...is the safest place here?

256
00:15:25,832 --> 00:15:27,072
What do you mean?

257
00:15:27,345 --> 00:15:28,425
Speak up.

258
00:15:28,985 --> 00:15:30,072
Where is it?

259
00:15:30,729 --> 00:15:31,822
I don't know.

260
00:15:31,847 --> 00:15:33,367
What a moron.

261
00:15:33,697 --> 00:15:35,137
It's the cafeteria.

262
00:15:35,393 --> 00:15:37,139
- The cafeteria?
- Yes.

263
00:15:37,776 --> 00:15:39,616
No ax can get through the shutters.

264
00:15:40,233 --> 00:15:41,273
So what?

265
00:15:41,567 --> 00:15:43,163
What do you mean "so what?"

266
00:15:44,457 --> 00:15:45,725
Kyung-jun's keys.

267
00:15:46,416 --> 00:15:47,670
Let's take them from him.

268
00:15:50,634 --> 00:15:51,914
We'll let you in.

269
00:15:52,650 --> 00:15:53,850
Join us.

270
00:16:02,008 --> 00:16:04,017
- Did it hurt?
- I'm fine.

271
00:16:14,915 --> 00:16:15,825
Are you okay?

272
00:16:16,294 --> 00:16:17,153
Yes.

273
00:16:25,682 --> 00:16:26,761
Thanks.

274
00:16:29,096 --> 00:16:30,576
If you're done, let's go.

275
00:16:31,024 --> 00:16:32,504
They'll suspect us of being late again.

276
00:16:34,615 --> 00:16:35,468
Okay.

277
00:16:36,163 --> 00:16:37,460
Let's go.

278
00:16:38,744 --> 00:16:39,784
